<title>USA: Fannie Mae to redeem $30 mln 1998 issue.</title>
<headline>Fannie Mae to redeem $30 mln 1998 issue.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal National Mortgage Association on Monday said that on October 21 it will redeem the entire $30 million principal amount of its 6.43 percent debentures that are due Sept 4, 1998. </p>
<p>Payment of principal amount plus interest accrued to the redemption date will be made to holders of record as of the close of business on Oct 18, 1996, Fannie Mae said.</p>
</text>
